Terrain source data — U.S. public domain
----------------------------------------
- Elevation: USGS 3DEP 1-meter LiDAR (Zion National Park, QL2 2016).
- Imagery:   USDA NAIP 2021 aerial imagery (RGBN).
- Land cover: USGS NLCD 2021.
Source: The National Map — https://apps.nationalmap.gov/downloader/
The terrain committed under data/ is derived (baked) from these public-domain
sources. Raw source rasters are not redistributed in this repository.

Textures — Creative Commons CC0 1.0
-----------------------------------
PBR ground, rock, bark, and foliage textures are sourced from CC0 texture
libraries: ambientCG (https://ambientcg.com/), Poly Haven
(https://polyhaven.com/), TextureCan (https://www.texturecan.com/), and
CGBookcase (https://www.cgbookcase.com/). Per-set source URLs and content
hashes are recorded in the SOURCES.md files under assets/textures/.

